Slices for a quick check along the flow path F1-F2-FC-F3: x = 0.9 m crosses the three
doorways, z = 2.3 m is the height of the fixed LEMs.
&SLCF QUANTITY='TEMPERATURE', PBX=0.9/
&SLCF QUANTITY='EXTINCTION COEFFICIENT', PBX=0.9/
&SLCF QUANTITY='TEMPERATURE', PBZ=2.3/
&SLCF QUANTITY='EXTINCTION COEFFICIENT', PBZ=2.3/

&TAIL /
